1
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her smile, her kindness, her kiss♪</font></font>

2
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her presumptions♪</font></font>

3
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She was in love, she was tired, she walked away♪</font></font>

4
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Only tears remained♪</font></font>

5
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Can't hold on, can't forget♪</font></font>

6
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:39,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Can't let go of her all-or-nothing love♪</font></font>

7
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:44,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Promises became a burden after all that hesitation♪</font></font>

8
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:47,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Leaving longing frozen into a winter night♪</font></font>

9
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That girl, my girl♪</font></font>

10
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:57,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The light's still on, but you're already far away♪</font></font>

11
00:00:57,780 --> 00:01:01,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The words reach my lips, but I can't get them out♪</font></font>

12
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:06,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That girl, my girl♪</font></font>

13
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪My voice echoes, but no one answers♪</font></font>

14
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Is this really how it ends for us?♪</font></font>

15
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[You don't have to be perfect tobe worthy of Love]</font></font>

16
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The Early Spring]</font></font>

17
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Adapted from The Early Spring on jjwxc.net, Author: Gu Niang Bie Ku]</font></font>

18
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've got three things to report.</font></font>

19
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">First,</font></font>

20
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:02,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">next week's denim promotion</font></font>

21
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is canceled.</font></font>

22
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The good news is I've already collected their deposits.</font></font>

23
00:02:08,150 --> 00:02:09,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Second,</font></font>

24
00:02:10,190 --> 00:02:12,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about the overdue payment you've been asking me to chase,</font></font>

25
00:02:12,750 --> 00:02:14,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they're asking for another two months.</font></font>

26
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's making excuses about being broke,</font></font>

27
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">saying</font></font>

28
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he might have to pull his kid out of kindergarten.</font></font>

29
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Last thing,</font></font>

30
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:27,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the sponsor for the ice sculpture event is cutting the budget.</font></font>

31
00:02:27,630 --> 00:02:28,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They said that's all they can offer.</font></font>

32
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Should we still do it?</font></font>

33
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know we need money to expand into new markets.</font></font>

34
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's do it.</font></font>

35
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:49,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Something is better than nothing.</font></font>

36
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:50,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Boss,</font></font>

37
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">keep your chin up.</font></font>

38
00:02:54,870 --> 00:02:57,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't have any good news,</font></font>

39
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I was the first one to join this company.</font></font>

40
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:02,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as this company exists,</font></font>

41
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not leaving.</font></font>

42
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if I don't get paid.</font></font>

43
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just don't stress yourself out.</font></font>

44
00:03:26,030 --> 00:03:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xing,</font></font>

45
00:03:27,910 --> 00:03:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how did it go</font></font>

46
00:03:29,710 --> 00:03:31,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with the bank?</font></font>

47
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, I want to take out a loan.</font></font>

48
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:35,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

49
00:03:35,310 --> 00:03:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll bring the property deed over.</font></font>

50
00:03:38,190 --> 00:03:39,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay. Thanks.</font></font>

51
00:03:49,150 --> 00:03:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you really selling it?</font></font>

52
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take it over.</font></font>

53
00:04:04,940 --> 00:04:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Episode 24]
[Shang Zhitao, Welcome Back to Beijing]</font></font>

54
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:14,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Li,</font></font>

55
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is your company looking</font></font>

56
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to expand?</font></font>

57
00:04:20,270 --> 00:04:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Guan,</font></font>

58
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:23,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd like to recommend a great business partner.</font></font>

59
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Someone will contact you to discuss the details.</font></font>

60
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:31,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I gave them your number.</font></font>

61
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you so much, Mr. Luan.</font></font>

62
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You helped us out a lot</font></font>

63
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when we needed it most.</font></font>

64
00:04:39,190 --> 00:04:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll be sure to tell Boss.</font></font>

65
00:04:41,270 --> 00:04:41,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

66
00:04:42,310 --> 00:04:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't tell her.</font></font>

67
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:44,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whether it works or not</font></font>

68
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">depends on Ms. Shang's negotiation skills.</font></font>

69
00:04:46,870 --> 00:04:47,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm just making the introduction.</font></font>

70
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't decide the outcome.</font></font>

71
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One more thing.</font></font>

72
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Send me your office address.</font></font>

73
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I bought two down jackets to send over.</font></font>

74
00:04:55,950 --> 00:04:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Pass them to her.</font></font>

75
00:04:56,950 --> 00:04:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure.</font></font>

76
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you, Mr. Luan.</font></font>

77
00:05:10,860 --> 00:05:15,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Beijing to Harbin Flight Booking Page]</font></font>

78
00:05:18,140 --> 00:05:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Complete Your Booking: Beijing to Harbin]</font></font>

79
00:05:48,430 --> 00:05:49,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao.</font></font>

80
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:55,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

81
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I mortgaged my apartment.</font></font>

82
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:02,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm just</font></font>

83
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">feeling a little down.</font></font>

84
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:14,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did you mortgage your apartment?</font></font>

85
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:17,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My company can barely stay afloat.</font></font>

86
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everything costs money.</font></font>

87
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm still waiting to collect 100,000 yuan.</font></font>

88
00:06:25,870 --> 00:06:27,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you need it,</font></font>

89
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can help you out.</font></font>

90
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:36,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian, you're trying to help,</font></font>

91
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:37,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but</font></font>

92
00:06:38,070 --> 00:06:39,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't need it.</font></font>

93
00:06:39,950 --> 00:06:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've figured something out.</font></font>

94
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I sold</font></font>

95
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the car</font></font>

96
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and mortgaged the house.</font></font>

97
00:06:45,390 --> 00:06:47,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I still have some savings.</font></font>

98
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:48,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know me.</font></font>

99
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to make it on my own.</font></font>

100
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you here?</font></font>

101
00:06:58,870 --> 00:06:59,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm here to apply.</font></font>

102
00:07:01,430 --> 00:07:02,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For what?</font></font>

103
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:04,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Driver, assistant,</font></font>

104
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or boyfriend.</font></font>

105
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm fine with any of them.</font></font>

106
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're not suitable.</font></font>

107
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How am I not?</font></font>

108
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In every way.</font></font>

109
00:07:15,750 --> 00:07:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ms. Shang,</font></font>

110
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">give me a chance.</font></font>

111
00:07:21,310 --> 00:07:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Luan,</font></font>

112
00:07:22,310 --> 00:07:23,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">this is a startup.</font></font>

113
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're too small</font></font>

114
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for someone like you.</font></font>

115
00:07:28,270 --> 00:07:29,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't charge much.</font></font>

116
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:32,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if we're hiring,</font></font>

117
00:07:32,790 --> 00:07:33,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we need someone local</font></font>

118
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who can stay long-term.</font></font>

119
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:37,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you're okay with it,</font></font>

120
00:07:37,870 --> 00:07:38,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can move here.</font></font>

121
00:07:42,430 --> 00:07:43,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's not necessary.</font></font>

122
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My next step</font></font>

123
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is expanding into digital advertising.</font></font>

124
00:07:47,190 --> 00:07:48,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's a completely new business.</font></font>

125
00:07:49,310 --> 00:07:50,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The execution and expertise required</font></font>

126
00:07:50,950 --> 00:07:52,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">aren't your strengths.</font></font>

127
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you still think you're the right fit, Mr. Luan?</font></font>

128
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you hire someone local,</font></font>

129
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">training and integrating them</font></font>

130
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will take at least six months.</font></font>

131
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you trust my abilities,</font></font>

132
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll work for free for the first six months.</font></font>

133
00:08:07,070 --> 00:08:07,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Luan,</font></font>

134
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">does Lime know what you're doing?</font></font>

135
00:08:11,430 --> 00:08:12,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Doesn't matter.</font></font>

136
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Be my driver then.</font></font>

137
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:30,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Coming.</font></font>

138
00:08:40,140 --> 00:08:42,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Disinfectant Spray]</font></font>

139
00:08:43,620 --> 00:08:45,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪You don't care about the story♪</font></font>

140
00:08:45,660 --> 00:08:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The more company I have, the lonelier I feel♪</font></font>

141
00:08:47,740 --> 00:08:49,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I don't need any blessings...♪</font></font>

142
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. and Mrs. Shang,</font></font>

143
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I brought you</font></font>

144
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">some Beijing specialties and some health supplements.</font></font>

145
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:56,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Even if it ends up being fruitless♪</font></font>

146
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪It's the fog, the countless thoughts that confine me♪</font></font>

147
00:08:59,620 --> 00:09:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Is it the beginning or the point of return?...♪</font></font>

148
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you here again?</font></font>

149
00:09:03,030 --> 00:09:03,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

150
00:09:04,020 --> 00:09:05,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If I don't express it precisely♪</font></font>

151
00:09:05,700 --> 00:09:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'll be even more critical of myself♪</font></font>

152
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:10,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Mountains or lakes♪</font></font>

153
00:09:10,580 --> 00:09:12,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'm just a passenger♪</font></font>

154
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:16,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Your radiance is like the light at night♪</font></font>

155
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:20,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Shining on me, but I am running♪</font></font>

156
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:24,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If I look at you from afar♪</font></font>

157
00:09:24,300 --> 00:09:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Whose sun will you become?♪</font></font>

158
00:09:27,940 --> 00:09:31,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I will escape from your city♪</font></font>

159
00:09:31,620 --> 00:09:35,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I will make sure I don't make a sound when I leave...♪</font></font>

160
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:35,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian,</font></font>

161
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke doesn't look well.</font></font>

162
00:09:39,900 --> 00:09:43,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I will be drenched in your name♪</font></font>

163
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:47,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I hate this stubbornness I was born with♪</font></font>

164
00:09:47,860 --> 00:09:51,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪But I will still see it through♪</font></font>

165
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:55,900
