<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪You should know♪</font></font>

332
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:20,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪You should know♪</font></font>

333
00:20:21,900 --> 00:20:24,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪You should know♪</font></font>

334
00:21:13,790 --> 00:21:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's probably fine.</font></font>

335
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She hasn't answered her phone. I'll go check on her.</font></font>

336
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian.</font></font>

337
00:21:22,590 --> 00:21:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is she out cold?</font></font>

338
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:24,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dad.</font></font>

339
00:21:26,310 --> 00:21:26,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

340
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was exhausted yesterday.</font></font>

341
00:21:28,920 --> 00:21:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't hear the phone.</font></font>

342
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:31,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry. Go back first.</font></font>

343
00:21:31,750 --> 00:21:33,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll clean up and get up soon.</font></font>

344
00:21:34,030 --> 00:21:34,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright.</font></font>

345
00:21:35,750 --> 00:21:36,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Shang.</font></font>

346
00:21:47,310 --> 00:21:48,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're here.</font></font>

347
00:21:54,030 --> 00:21:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You two</font></font>

348
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">aren't wearing enough.</font></font>

349
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:00,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come upstairs now.</font></font>

350
00:22:09,790 --> 00:22:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. and Mrs. Shang,</font></font>

351
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:12,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll take responsibility for Tao.</font></font>

352
00:22:20,590 --> 00:22:21,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's going on here?</font></font>

353
00:22:22,070 --> 00:22:22,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Explain yourselves.</font></font>

354
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:28,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well...</font></font>

355
00:22:28,030 --> 00:22:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Keep quiet.</font></font>

356
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:34,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You talk.</font></font>

357
00:22:36,240 --> 00:22:37,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here's the truth.</font></font>

358
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sure you already know</font></font>

359
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:42,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about what happened between Tao and me.</font></font>

360
00:22:43,270 --> 00:22:45,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We were together for six years.</font></font>

361
00:22:46,480 --> 00:22:48,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because of some misunderstandings,</font></font>

362
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:50,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she broke up with me.</font></font>

363
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But when we met again this time,</font></font>

364
00:22:55,510 --> 00:22:56,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we realized</font></font>

365
00:22:56,270 --> 00:22:57,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we still had feelings for each other.</font></font>

366
00:22:59,590 --> 00:23:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's basically it.</font></font>

367
00:23:05,160 --> 00:23:06,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're not even married,</font></font>

368
00:23:06,550 --> 00:23:07,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">yet you're already living together.</font></font>

369
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:09,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's no way to behave.</font></font>

370
00:23:09,790 --> 00:23:11,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could you be so foolish, Tao?</font></font>

371
00:23:12,350 --> 00:23:13,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can get married.</font></font>

372
00:23:14,350 --> 00:23:15,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm ready anytime.</font></font>

373
00:23:23,270 --> 00:23:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm just waiting for Tao's answer.</font></font>

374
00:23:32,400 --> 00:23:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I mean it.</font></font>

375
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:34,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. and Mrs. Shang,</font></font>

376
00:23:36,030 --> 00:23:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know</font></font>

377
00:23:36,680 --> 00:23:38,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a woman's reputation matters.</font></font>

378
00:23:38,830 --> 00:23:39,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll take responsibility.</font></font>

379
00:23:50,750 --> 00:23:51,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You heard him.</font></font>

380
00:23:52,640 --> 00:23:54,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are we still sitting here?</font></font>

381
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:56,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He wants to marry her.</font></font>

382
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let them talk it over.</font></font>

383
00:23:57,550 --> 00:23:58,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's leave.</font></font>

384
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tao, put on more clothes. Don't catch a cold.</font></font>

385
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You two talk it over.</font></font>

386
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:06,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll come back later.</font></font>

387
00:24:27,270 --> 00:24:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong, Flora?</font></font>

388
00:24:31,510 --> 00:24:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What did you call me?</font></font>

389
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My dear wife.</font></font>

390
00:24:40,750 --> 00:24:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was telling the truth.</font></font>

391
00:24:42,790 --> 00:24:44,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If we hadn't broken up,</font></font>

392
00:24:44,750 --> 00:24:46,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'd already be married.</font></font>

393
00:24:48,750 --> 00:24:50,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If we hadn't broken up,</font></font>

394
00:24:52,240 --> 00:24:53,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">our kid would probably be grown up by now.</font></font>

395
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You really just say whatever comes to mind.</font></font>

396
00:24:58,110 --> 00:24:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can you really take responsibility?</font></font>

397
00:24:59,350 --> 00:25:00,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can.</font></font>

398
00:25:04,880 --> 00:25:06,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I mean every word.</font></font>

399
00:25:09,310 --> 00:25:10,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Back then,</font></font>

400
00:25:10,070 --> 00:25:11,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought I'd planned everything perfectly.</font></font>

401
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:13,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd spend six months in the US,</font></font>

402
00:25:14,510 --> 00:25:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then come back,</font></font>

403
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:16,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you'd receive the Specialist title you deserved.</font></font>

404
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:23,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tao.</font></font>

405
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:27,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to spend the rest of my life with you.</font></font>

406
00:25:42,110 --> 00:25:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Beijing branch has just opened.</font></font>

407
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:46,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">From now on, I'll be splitting my time between Harbin and Beijing.</font></font>

408
00:25:47,340 --> 00:25:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[2021, Beijing]</font></font>

409
00:25:53,680 --> 00:25:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke,</font></font>

410
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:55,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we're going back to Beijing.</font></font>

411
00:25:58,310 --> 00:25:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

412
00:26:05,510 --> 00:26:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I got praised at the summit.</font></font>

413
00:26:07,680 --> 00:26:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ms. Shang Zhitao,</font></font>

414
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'd like to invite you back to Lime</font></font>

415
00:26:10,960 --> 00:26:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to share your experience as one of our event partners.</font></font>

416
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure.</font></font>

417
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao,</font></font>

418
00:26:23,270 --> 00:26:24,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">welcome back to Beijing.</font></font>

419
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:43,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao.</font></font>

420
00:26:44,960 --> 00:26:46,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Flora</font></font>

421
00:26:46,070 --> 00:26:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is like a different person now.</font></font>

422
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's New Year's Eve.</font></font>

423
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't stay out too late.</font></font>

424
00:26:52,550 --> 00:26:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Happy New Year in advance, everyone.</font></font>

425
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Happy New Year.</font></font>

426
00:26:56,830 --> 00:26:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Flora.</font></font>

427
00:26:59,310 --> 00:27:00,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's grab a meal sometime.</font></font>

428
00:27:00,830 --> 00:27:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As friends.</font></font>

429
00:27:03,550 --> 00:27:05,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll talk about dinner another time.</font></font>

430
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're supposed to go grocery shopping together.</font></font>

431
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:11,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Flora, I have to ask.</font></font>

432
00:27:11,590 --> 00:27:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How did you ever put up</font></font>

433
00:27:13,350 --> 00:27:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with his temper?</font></font>

434
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:16,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you seriously</font></font>

435
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">gaslighting my wife in front of me?</font></font>

436
00:27:26,550 --> 00:27:28,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're heading out. Bye.</font></font>

437
00:27:28,030 --> 00:27:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bye.</font></font>

438
00:27:28,640 --> 00:27:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bye.</font></font>

439
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

440
00:27:39,310 --> 00:27:40,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What time will you be back?</font></font>

441
00:27:40,110 --> 00:27:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're going shopping for Chinese New Year's supplies together.</font></font>

442
00:27:42,880 --> 00:27:44,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I still have something to do.</font></font>

443
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:45,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll be back later.</font></font>

444
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:50,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Also,</font></font>

445
00:27:51,790 --> 00:27:53,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I might be bringing someone home.</font></font>

446
00:28:09,790 --> 00:28:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where are we going?</font></font>

447
00:28:12,880 --> 00:28:13,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come with me.</font></font>

448
00:28:20,500 --> 00:28:24,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Flora's Museum of Time & Eternity]</font></font>

449
00:28:31,310 --> 00:28:31,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Welcome to</font></font>

450
00:28:31,790 --> 00:28:33,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Flora's Museum of Time & Eternity.</font></font>

451
00:28:34,440 --> 00:28:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm your personal tour guide,</font></font>

452
00:28:37,310 --> 00:28:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian.</font></font>

453
00:28:43,860 --> 00:28:47,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And so, I will protect myself well♪</font></font>

454
00:28:47,220 --> 00:28:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪You don't care about the story♪</font></font>

455
00:28:49,220 --> 00:28:51,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The more company I have, the lonelier I feel♪</font></font>

456
00:28:51,300 --> 00:28:53,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I don't need any blessings♪</font></font>

457
00:28:53,220 --> 00:28:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I will set the boundary♪</font></font>

458
00:28:55,380 --> 00:28:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And I will not run away♪</font></font>

459
00:28:57,940 --> 00:28:59,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Even if it ends up being fruitless♪</font></font>

460
00:29:00,060 --> 00:29:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪It's the fog, the countless thoughts that confine me♪</font></font>

461
00:29:03,220 --> 00:29:05,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Is it the beginning or the point of return?...♪</font></font>

462
00:29:06,550 --> 00:29:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is Shang Zhitao in 2012,</font></font>

463
00:29:07,960 --> 00:29:09,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when she first arrived in Beijing.</font></font>

464
00:29:09,220 --> 00:29:11,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'll be even more critical of myself♪</font></font>

465
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She was terrified</font></font>

466
00:29:14,750 --> 00:29:15,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but also curious</font></font>

467
00:29:16,400 --> 00:29:17,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about this unfamiliar city.</font></font>

468
00:29:18,480 --> 00:29:19,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She treated everything with awe.</font></font>

469
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She devoted all of her time</font></font>

470
00:29:24,750 --> 00:29:26,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to work.</font></font>

471
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:29,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Unfortunately,</font></font>

472
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:30,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she wound up with a boss</font></font>

473
00:29:30,920 --> 00:29:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who tried to make her quit every day.</font></font>

474
00:29:33,750 --> 00:29:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That boss was a real jerk.</font></font>

475
00:29:35,180 --> 00:29:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I will make sure I don't make a sound when I leave...♪</font></font>

476
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:41,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luckily,</font></font>

477
00:29:41,270 --> 00:29:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I happened to run into my boss that night.</font></font>

478
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:45,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He drove me home.</font></font>

479
00:29:50,750 --> 00:29:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you know something?</font></font>

480
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:54,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The first time I drove you home,</font></font>

481
00:29:54,880 --> 00:29:55,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it wasn't on my way.</font></font>

482
00:29:55,460 --> 00:29:59,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If you can't forget me♪</font></font>

483
00:29:59,880 --> 00:30:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It never was.</font></font>

484
00:30:02,400 --> 00:30:03,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I took the long way because I wanted to drive you home.</font></font>

485
00:30:05,590 --> 00:30:06,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get in.</font></font>

486
00:30:16,660 --> 00:30:20,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Make every day count. Wishing you all the best as you keep growing. Anonymous]</font></font>

487
00:30:23,740 --> 00:30:27,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And so, I will protect myself well♪</font></font>

488
00:30:27,340 --> 00:30:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪You don't care about the story♪</font></font>

489
00:30:29,180 --> 00:30:31,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The more company I have, the lonelier I feel♪</font></font>

490
00:30:31,340 --> 00:30:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I don't need any blessings♪</font></font>

491
00:30:33,060 --> 00:30:35,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I will set the boundary♪</font></font>

492
00:30:35,420 --> 00:30:37,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And I will not run away...♪</font></font>

493
00:30:37,830 --> 00:30:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao, you were brave back then.</font></font>

494
00:30:41,270 --> 00:30:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I went there to save you.</font></font>

495
00:30:43,480 --> 00:30:44,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But in the end,</font></font>

496
00:30:45,030 --> 00:30:46,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you were the one who saved me.</font></font>

497
00:30:47,460 --> 00:30:49,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If I don't express it precisely♪</font></font>

498
00:30:49,260 --> 00:30:51,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'll be even more critical of myself♪</font></font>

499
00:30:51,300 --> 00:30:53,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Mountains or lakes♪</font></font>

500
00:30:53,940 --> 00:30:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'm just a passenger...♪</font></font>

501
00:30:58,240 --> 00:30:59,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao.</font></font>

502
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:01,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's something I need to say.</font></font>

503
00:31:04,830 --> 00:31:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">About the handbag.</font></font>

504
00:31:08,350 --> 00:31:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My mother loves handbags,</font></font>

505
00:31:11,270 --> 00:31:12,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I mistakenly assumed</font></font>

506
00:31:13,160 --> 00:31:15,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">every woman did too.</font></font>

507
00:31:16,440 --> 00:31:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I gave it to you,</font></font>

508
00:31:19,350 --> 00:31:20,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just wanted to give you the best,</font></font>

509
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I simply didn't know how to express how much I cared about you.</font></font>

510
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:31,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sorry</font></font>

511
00:31:31,590 --> 00:31:32,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I made you uncomfortable.</font></font>

512
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:37,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your old bag was worn out.</font></font>

513
00:31:38,550 --> 00:31:39,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have a new one.</font></font>

514
00:31:39,380 --> 00:31:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Please persevere, let me believe you once more...♪</font></font>

515
00:31:44,200 --> 00:31:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

516
00:31:55,200 --> 00:31:57,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I remember you complimented me.</font></font>

517
00:31:58,920 --> 00:32:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You hired a great employee.</font></font>

518
00:32:00,680 --> 00:32:02,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She turned my impossible into a possibility.</font></font>

519
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The prototype of the database you've all seen</font></font>

520
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:07,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was led by</font></font>

521
00:32:07,640 --> 00:32:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">our new teammate, Flora.</font></font>

522
00:32:11,750 --> 00:32:13,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just wanted everyone to know</font></font>

523
00:32:14,070 --> 00:32:15,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that you'd accomplished something amazing.</font></font>

524
00:32:16,440 --> 00:32:17,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was proud of you.</font></font>

525
00:32:36,030 --> 00:32:38,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">These are the flowers Sun Yuanzhu gave me.</font></font>

526
00:32:39,000 --> 00:32:39,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

527
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Actually, they suited you perfectly.</font></font>

528
00:32:45,030 --> 00:32:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I lied because I was jealous.</font></font>

529
00:32:50,590 --> 00:32:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sun Yuanzhu was a wonderful person.</font></font>

530
00:32:52,790 --> 00:32:54,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I should've thanked him.</font></font>

531
00:33:06,030 --> 00:33:07,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just call me Luan Nian.</font></font>

532
00:33:08,790 --> 00:33:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian.</font></font>

533
00:33:14,260 --> 00:33:16,660
