536
00:33:22,440 --> 00:33:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He just didn't realize it yet.</font></font>

537
00:33:24,590 --> 00:33:26,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He was the first one to fall for Shang Zhitao.</font></font>

538
00:33:26,620 --> 00:33:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Why I stupid to prove♪</font></font>

539
00:33:29,260 --> 00:33:30,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The love, oh...♪</font></font>

540
00:33:32,350 --> 00:33:34,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can control your feelings for someone.</font></font>

541
00:33:36,790 --> 00:33:37,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you mind,</font></font>

542
