543
00:33:41,030 --> 00:33:42,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Encourage you. Praise you more.</font></font>

544
00:33:42,790 --> 00:33:43,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll remember that.</font></font>

545
00:33:45,030 --> 00:33:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We promised</font></font>

546
00:33:46,750 --> 00:33:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to be honest with each other.</font></font>

547
00:33:50,440 --> 00:33:52,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not good with sweet words,</font></font>

548
00:33:52,310 --> 00:33:53,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I miss you.</font></font>

549
00:33:54,160 --> 00:33:55,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to see you.</font></font>

550
00:33:59,030 --> 00:34:00,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He couldn't express himself.</font></font>

551
00:34:00,680 --> 00:34:01,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He didn't know how to love.</font></font>

552
00:34:02,920 --> 00:34:04,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He lacked empathy.</font></font>

553
