<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He once got into a fight.</font></font>

554
00:34:07,960 --> 00:34:08,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He pretended to be sick.</font></font>

555
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And for Shang Zhitao,</font></font>

556
00:34:15,150 --> 00:34:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he traveled across</font></font>

557
00:34:17,030 --> 00:34:18,360
