559
00:34:21,550 --> 00:34:22,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Quietly.</font></font>

560
00:34:23,020 --> 00:34:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪My fool♪</font></font>

561
00:34:28,180 --> 00:34:30,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪But I used to say♪</font></font>

562
00:34:30,660 --> 00:34:34,540
