563
00:34:35,580 --> 00:34:36,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Away♪</font></font>

564
00:34:37,980 --> 00:34:44,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪It's fate that guides me to you♪</font></font>

565
00:34:46,780 --> 00:34:49,100
