626
00:39:09,700 --> 00:39:11,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Will you listen to it♪</font></font>

627
00:39:11,700 --> 00:39:15,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Or will you reply to me in silence?♪</font></font>

628
00:39:16,020 --> 00:39:20,900
