635
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:48,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes!</font></font>

636
00:39:48,800 --> 00:39:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao!</font></font>

637
00:39:52,780 --> 00:39:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Be happy!</font></font>

638
