<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes!</font></font>

639
00:39:58,820 --> 00:40:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Too many hurdles in this world...♪</font></font>

