646
00:40:19,880 --> 00:40:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And that warmth will never fade.</font></font>

647
00:40:22,710 --> 00:40:23,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">May you,</font></font>

648
